{"articleNo":"2558","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2558&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 2학기 등록금 분할납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.08","hit":"14405","attachments":[{"name":"대학,산업대학원,교육대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2558&attachNo=1732"},{"name":"샘플1.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2558&attachNo=1799"},{"name":"컨설팅학과, 컨설팅대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2558&attachNo=1981"},{"name":"일반대학원.JPG","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2558&attachNo=2067"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#003300\">- 2010학년도 2학기 등록금 분할납부 안내 -</font><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (재학생)</strong><br></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><hr><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">분할납부 신청 명단은 신청서 접수 다음 날&nbsp;<br>’학사안내 공지사항’에 게시합니다.(학번만 표시함)<br><br><hr><br><br>1. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">신청기간</font></strong> : <u><font color=\"#003366\"><strong>08.02.(월)~08.13.(금) 오후 6시까지</strong></font></u></font><br><br><br>2. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">신청방법</font></strong> : </font><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">우편신청(또는 방문신청)</font><br></u></strong></font><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong>본인도장, 보호자도장을 반드시 찍어 주시기 바랍니다.<br></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (본인 및 보호자도장이 없는 경우에는 분할납부를 신청할수 없습니다.)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 우편신청시 주소 : 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공대 경리팀(글로벌관 533호)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 방문신청시 : 경리팀(글로벌관 533호)으로 오시기 바랍니다.</font>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>3. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <font color=\"#800000\"><strong>고지서발급</strong></font></font> : 원스톱서비스에서 발급, <u>8월 14일부터 발급 예정</u></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>4. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">납부기간<br></font></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 1차분을 납부기간에 납부하지 않을시 분할납부 신청이 취소됩니다.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp; <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\">-&nbsp;<font color=\"#003366\"><strong><u>1차</u></strong></font> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">08.17.(화)~08.20.(금)</font><br></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">2차</font></u></strong> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">09.16.(목)~09.17.(금)<br></font></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">3차</font></u></strong> : </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#003366\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">10.18.(월)~10.19.(화)</font><br></strong></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><u><font color=\"#003366\">4차</font></u></strong> : </font><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\">11.16.(화)~11.17.(수)<br></font></strong><br><br>5. <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffcc\">분할납부 <strong><font color=\"#800000\">납부장소</font></strong> : <font color=\"#003366\"><strong><u>농협, 대구은행, 신한은행, 우체국</u></strong></font></font></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>6. 분할 납부 금액 : 분할납부신청서 참조</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>7. 분할납부신청서 첨부해놨습니다.(절대 수정 불가)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - <u>’대학, 산업대학원, 교육대학원용</u>’과 ’<u>일반대학원용’</u>,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>’컨설팅학과, 컨설팅대학원용</u>’&nbsp;신청서가 다릅니다.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청서 작성시 내용을 정확하게 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>8. 2010학년도 2학기 <font color=\"#800000\">휴학시에는 등록금을 완납</font>하여야 합니다.</font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>9. 2010학년도 2학기 <font color=\"#800000\">재입학자 및 한국장학재단 학자금융자를 받는&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생은&nbsp;분할납부를 신청할 수 없습니다.</font></font></p>\n<p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br>10. 분할납부 문의전화 : 054-478-7115 (경리팀)<br><br><br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2010. 07. 09.</strong><br><br><br><strong><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 총&nbsp;&nbsp; 무&nbsp;&nbsp; 과&nbsp;&nbsp; 장</font></strong></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
